The code under src/ is a port of Base UI (@base-ui/react 1.8.0,
https://github.com/mui/base-ui, packages/react/src and packages/utils/src)
from React to Solid 2. Each ported file names its upstream path in a header
comment. The ported code keeps Base UI's copyright and this license.

The code under src/sheet/ is not covered by this license: it is a port of
React Aria's Sheet (react-aria-components 1.22.1 and react-aria 3.53.1,
https://github.com/adobe/react-spectrum), Copyright 2020-2026 Adobe, under
the Apache License 2.0 in src/sheet/LICENSE. Each file there names its
upstream path and copyright and states that it was ported to Solid 2 and
changed, as does test/browser/sheet.test.ts (from upstream's Sheet tests).
The parts it
reuses from the rest of src/ (the dialog's root, store, portal, title and
close) stay under this license.

